<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS QUALIFYING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS QUALIFYING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from women's qualifying in</p>
<p>the European figure skating championships at Bercy on Monday</p>
<p>(top 15 from each of two groups qualify for main event):</p>
<p>Group One:</p>
<p>1. Elena Liashenko (Ukraine) 1.0 factored placements.</p>
<p>2. Eva-Marie Fitze (Germany) 2.0</p>
<p>3. Yulia Vorobieva (Azerbaijan) 3.0</p>
<p>4. Julia Lautova (Austria) 4.0</p>
<p>5. LaetitiA Hubert (France) 5.0</p>
<p>6. Surya Bonaly (France) 6.0</p>
<p>7. Anna Rechnio (Poland) 7.0</p>
